{#
| Variable                  | Type      | Description                                     |
|---------------------------|-----------|-------------------------------------------------|
| component                 | object    | merchant settings from twilight.json            |
| component.title           | string    | heading first part                              |
| component.title_highlight | string    | highlighted heading word(s) (royal blue)        |
| component.subtitle        | string    | subheading                                      |
| component.products        | Product[] | the TWO selected products (first two are used)  |
| component.show_image      | bool      | show the product image                          |
| component.show_badge      | bool      | show the sale/discount badge on the image       |
| component.show_brand      | bool      | show the brand/category line                    |
| component.show_chips      | bool      | show the spec chips                             |
| component.show_price      | bool      | show the price                                  |
| component.show_add        | bool      | show the add-to-cart button                     |
| component.show_wishlist   | bool      | show the wishlist (like) button                 |
| position                  | int       | sorting block                                   |

Two products shown side-by-side using the Standard Product Card design (reuses the
.qprod card + the qprod-image partial built for "خصيصاً من قصة"). Every element is
merchant-toggleable. Dynamic Salla data only — the image carousel auto-wires via
initCardCarousels() in home.js.
#}
<section class="s-block qdstd" id="qdstd-{{ position }}">
    <div class="container">

        {# centered heading #}
        {% if component.title or component.title_highlight or component.subtitle %}
            <div class="qdstd__head">
                <h2 class="qdstd__title">
                    <span class="qdstd__title-hl">{{ component.title_highlight }}</span> {{ component.title }}
                </h2>
                {% if component.subtitle %}
                    <p class="qdstd__subtitle">{{ component.subtitle }}</p>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if component.products|length %}
        <div class="qdstd__grid">
            {% for product in component.products|slice(0, 2) %}
                <article class="qprod qdstd__card">
                    {# image + discount badge (swipe carousel when multi-image) #}
                    {% if component.show_image %}
                        {% set badge_text = null %}
                        {% if component.show_badge %}
                            {% if product.is_on_sale and product.promotion_title %}
                                {% set badge_text = product.promotion_title %}
                            {% elseif product.is_on_sale %}
                                {% set badge_text = trans('blocks.qissa.sale') %}
                            {% endif %}
                        {% endif %}
                        {% include 'components.partials.qprod-image' with { product: product, badge_text: badge_text } %}
                    {% endif %}

                    {# info #}
                    <div class="qprod__info">
                        {% if component.show_brand and product.brand.name %}
                            <span class="qprod__cat">{{ product.brand.name }}</span>
                        {% endif %}
                        <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="qprod__name">{{ product.name }}</a>

                        {# spec chips (from product subtitle, split on the Arabic comma ، ) #}
                        {% if component.show_chips and product.subtitle %}
                            <div class="qprod__chips">
                                {% for chip in product.subtitle|split('،') %}
                                    {% if chip|trim %}<span class="qprod__chip">{{ chip|trim }}</span>{% endif %}
                                {% endfor %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}

                        {# price #}
                        {% if component.show_price %}
                            <div class="qprod__price">
                                {% if product.is_on_sale %}
                                    <b class="qprod__price-now">{{ product.sale_price|money }}</b>
                                    <s class="qprod__price-old">{{ product.regular_price|money }}</s>
                                {% else %}
                                    <b class="qprod__price-now">{{ product.price|money }}</b>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>

                    {# buttons — like LEFT, add-to-cart fills RIGHT #}
                    {% if component.show_add or component.show_wishlist %}
                        <div class="qprod__btns">
                            {% if component.show_wishlist %}
                                <button class="qprod__like" data-id="{{ product.id }}" onclick="salla.wishlist.toggle('{{ product.id }}')" aria-label="المفضلة">
                                    <i class="sicon-heart"></i>
                                </button>
                            {% endif %}
                            {% if component.show_add %}
                                <button class="qprod__add" type="button"
                                    onclick="salla.cart.addItem({ id: '{{ product.id }}', quantity: 1 })">
                                    <span>{{ trans('blocks.qissa.add_to_cart') }}</span>
                                    <i class="sicon-shopping-bag"></i>
                                </button>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}

    </div>
</section>
